  "description": "<p>Garden of Healing — on cast, verdant growth blooms around the caster (with an earthen cast flourish at high quality). When an ally in the garden takes damage, a green bolt streaks to them and blooms with a short divine healing chime. When the lingering calm effect is applied, a soft abjuration rune (free, hue-shifted toward green) or a green-tinted boon refraction (Patreon) settles on the token.</p><p><strong>Keywords:</strong> garden-of-healing</p><p><em>Single blueprint, three dispatch names: <code>spell:garden-of-healing</code> (Spell Message), <code>trove-healing:garden-of-healing</code> (Handler: Healing), and <code>effect:spell-effect-garden-of-healing</code> (Effect Granted). Branched via healing <code>animation-name</code> and effect item slug. Calm path runs at all quality tiers; no SFX.</em></p>",
